  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Sigil</strong></p><h3>Seal</h3><p>Make a <strong>Power Roll</strong> against a target within Far range. On a success, <strong>spend a Hope</strong> to let dark flames consume the target, dealing <strong>d6+1</strong> energy damage using your Proficiency. The target must make a Reaction Roll (13) or is temporarily <em>Ignited</em>. While <em>Ignited</em>, they take <strong>2d6</strong> energy damage if they are still Ignited at the end of their action.</p><p><strong>Seal:</strong> After you successfully use this card, you can <strong>mark a Hit Point</strong> to flip it to its <strong>Release</strong> side.</p><h3>Release</h3><p>Make a <strong>Power Roll</strong> against a target within Far range. On a success dark flames consume the target, dealing <strong>d12+3</strong> energy damage using your Proficiency. The target and all targets within Very Close range of them become temporarily <em>Ignited</em>. While <em>Ignited</em>, they take <strong>2d6</strong> energy damage if they are still Ignited at the end of their action.</p><p><strong>Release:</strong> After you use this card, flip it back to its <strong>Seal</strong> side.</p>",
