    "gmNotes": "Two-sided Sigil. The card's resource marks the side it shows (0 = Seal, 1 = Release). After a successful Seal use, mark a Hit Point by hand and set the resource to 1. Each Release action spends it, which flips the card back to Seal. A long rest resets it to Seal. The Seal side's Ignited applies only to a target that fails its Reaction Roll (13); TNU Reaction Rolls name no trait, so the roll is made by hand.",
